tasks.description:
在 app/models/ 目录下创建 Note 模型。需要修改 app/models/__init__.py 添加导入。模型包含: id, title, content, tags, created_at, updated_at。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str, tags: [str]}) -> {id, title, content, tags, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, tags, created_at, updated_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, title, content, tags, created_at, updated_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str, tags: [str]}) -> {id, title, content, tags, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

在 app/routes/ 目录下创建 notes.py 路由文件。需要在 app/__init__.py 注册 notes_bp 蓝图到 /api 前缀。提供 CRUD API，包括创建、读取、更新和删除笔记。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str, tags: [str]}) -> {id, title, content, tags, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, tags, created_at, updated_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, title, content, tags, created_at, updated_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str, tags: [str]}) -> {id, title, content, tags, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

在 templates/ 目录下创建 notes.html 前端页面。页面包含表单用于提交新笔记，以及列表展示所有笔记。需要支持搜索功能，用户可以通过标题或标签搜索笔记。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str, tags: [str]}) -> {id, title, content, tags, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, tags, created_at, updated_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, title, content, tags, created_at, updated_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str, tags: [str]}) -> {id, title, content, tags, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}

在 app/routes/notes.py 中添加搜索功能的 API 端点。支持通过标题或标签搜索笔记。需要修改前端 notes.html 页面，添加搜索框并调用搜索 API。

API Specification (ALL TASKS MUST USE SAME API):
- POST /notes (request: {title: str, content: str, tags: [str]}) -> {id, title, content, tags, created_at, updated_at}
- GET /notes -> [{id, title, content, tags, created_at, updated_at}]
- GET /notes/{id} -> {id, title, content, tags, created_at, updated_at}
- PUT /notes/{id} (request: {title: str, content: str, tags: [str]}) -> {id, title, content, tags, created_at, updated_at}
- DELETE /notes/{id} -> {message: str}
- GET /notes/search (request: {query: str}) -> [{id, title, content, tags, created_at, updated_at}]

初始化项目结构，包括创建 app/ 目录、配置文件、以及必要的依赖文件（如 requirements.txt）。需要在 app/__init__.py 中设置应用工厂函数。

